{"title":"1.0.2","sourceTitle":"1.0.2/pt-br","html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"pt-BR\" dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"mw-pt-languages noprint navigation-not-searchable\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"mw-pt-languages-label\">Other languages:</div><ul class=\"mw-pt-languages-list\"><li><a href=\"/1.0.2/de\" class=\"mw-pt-progress mw-pt-progress--complete\" title=\"1.0.2 (100% translated)\" lang=\"de\" dir=\"ltr\">Deutsch</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/1.0.2\" class=\"mw-pt-languages-ui mw-pt-progress mw-pt-progress--complete\" title=\"1.0.2 (100% translated)\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">English</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"mw-pt-languages-selected mw-pt-progress mw-pt-progress--complete\" lang=\"pt-BR\" dir=\"ltr\">português do Brasil</span></li>\n<li><a href=\"/1.0.2/zh\" class=\"mw-pt-progress mw-pt-progress--med\" title=\"1.0.2 (67% translated)\" lang=\"zh\" dir=\"ltr\">中文</a></li></ul></div>\n<div style=\"margin: 0 1em 1em; padding: 4px; border-color: #382b1e; border-width: 3px; border-style: solid; float:right; width:300px; border-radius: 4px; background-color: #e0cfbb;\">\n<table style=\"border-spacing: 2px; width: 100%;\">\n<tbody><tr><th colspan=\"2\" style=\"background: rgb(91,76,62); background: linear-gradient(to bottom, rgba(91,76,62,1) 0px, rgba(91,76,62,0) 5px, rgba(56,43,30,0) calc(100% - 5px), rgba(56,43,30,1) 100%), linear-gradient(to right, rgba(91,76,62,1) 0px, rgba(69,52,36,1) 5px, rgba(69,52,36,1) 50%, rgba(69,52,36,1) calc(100% - 5px), rgba(56,43,30,1) 100%);&#125;&#125;\">\n<big><b><span style=\"color: #e0cfbb\">1.0.2/pt-br</span></b></big></th></tr>\n<tr><td colspan=\"2\" style=\"margin:auto; text-align:center;\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\"><b><i>\"Blocks, Music, More world height, Undo and more\"</i></b></span></td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"width:50%\"><b>Release date</b></td><td>October 3, 2016</td></tr>\n<tr><td colspan=\"2\" style=\"background: rgb(91,76,62); background: linear-gradient(to bottom, rgba(91,76,62,1) 0px, rgba(91,76,62,0) 5px, rgba(56,43,30,0) calc(100% - 5px), rgba(56,43,30,1) 100%), linear-gradient(to right, rgba(91,76,62,1) 0px, rgba(69,52,36,1) 5px, rgba(69,52,36,1) 50%, rgba(69,52,36,1) calc(100% - 5px), rgba(56,43,30,1) 100%); height: 1.5em; text-align:center;\"><b><span style=\"color: #e0cfbb; margin:auto;\">Version chronology</span></b></td></tr>\n<tr><td colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align:center\"><table style=\"width: 100%; margin: auto;\"><tbody><tr><td style=\"width:50%\"><a href=\"/0.9.5\" title=\"0.9.5\"><span style=\"margin-right:-0.35em\">◄</span>◄ 0.9.5</a><br /><a href=\"/1.0.1\" title=\"1.0.1\">◄ 1.0.1</a></td><td><a href=\"/1.1.0\" title=\"1.1.0\">1.1.0 <span style=\"margin-right:-0.35em\">►</span>►</a><br /><a href=\"/1.0.3\" title=\"1.0.3\">1.0.3 ►</a></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n</div>\n<p><br />\n<b>1.0.2</b>, também conhecido como Blocks, Music, More world height, Undo e mais, é uma pequena atualização com pequenos ajustes e correções.\n</p><p><span id=\"Features\"></span>\n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Características\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Características</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Ajustes\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Ajustes</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Correções\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Correções</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Referências\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Referências</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span id=\"Caracter.C3.ADsticas\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Características\">Características</span></h2>\n<ul><li>Adicionada capacidade de configurar a altura do mundo diretamente na tela do singleplayer</li>\n<li>Duas novas faixas musicais: Mirror e Groove.</li>\n<li>Atualizações de edição mundial\n<ul><li>Adicionados recursos de desfazer/refazer. Agora podemos executar/desfazer até 20 vezes</li>\n<li>Adicionadas verificações de sanidade a cada operação, evitando que o jogador faça coisas que possam potencialmente travar o servidor\n<ul><li>Pode ser desativado via /we sovp 0</li></ul></li></ul></li>\n<li>Os itens da lista para um jogador agora são um pouco mais informativos:\n<ul><li>mostrar Cheats On/Off e altura do mundo</li>\n<li>mostrar o tempo total de jogo no mundo real</li></ul></li>\n<li>Adicionados novos blocos\n<ul><li>Argila Endurecida (4 variantes)</li>\n<li>Fogão apagado e aceso</li>\n<li>Escadas de paralelepípedos</li></ul></li>\n<li>Adicionado perfil de frame tick (CTRL+F10) para ajudar a rastrear problemas de desempenho</li>\n<li>O instalador finalmente está devidamente assinado em código</li>\n<li>Adicionado sistema de música adequado que seleciona faixas de acordo com o dia e estilo de jogo</li></ul>\n<p><span id=\"Tweaks\"></span>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Ajustes\">Ajustes</span></h2>\n<ul><li>Texturas de tijolos aprimoradas</li>\n<li>Geração mundial ajustada para gerar significativamente menos estratos rochosos</li></ul>\n<p><span id=\"Fixes\"></span>\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Corre.C3.A7.C3.B5es\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Correções\">Correções</span></h2>\n<ul><li>Corrigida falha do servidor usando Mono: o servidor agora deve rodar no Linux</li></ul>\n<p><span id=\"References\"></span>\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Refer.C3.AAncias\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Referências\">Referências</span></h2>\n<ol><li><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://www.vintagestory.at/blog.html/news/blocks-music-more-world-height-undo-and-more-v102-r50/\">https://www.vintagestory.at/blog.html/news/blocks-music-more-world-height-undo-and-more-v102-r50/</a></li></ol>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261111115522\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.017 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.030 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 187/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 7823/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 1365/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 11/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 754/5000000 bytes\nLua time usage: 0.000/7 seconds\nLua virtual size: 4829184/52428800 bytes\nLua estimated memory usage: 135168 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   14.970      1 Template:Version_info\n100.00%   14.970      1 -total\n 93.17%   13.947      1 Template:Infobox\n 10.83%    1.622      3 Template:Infobox_row\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wikinew-vs_:pcache:idhash:169839-0!canonical and timestamp 20261111115522 and revision id 376596. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>","sections":[{"toclevel":1,"level":"2","line":"Características","number":"1","index":"1","fromtitle":"1.0.2/pt-br","byteoffset":396,"anchor":"Características","linkAnchor":"Características"},{"toclevel":1,"level":"2","line":"Ajustes","number":"2","index":"2","fromtitle":"1.0.2/pt-br","byteoffset":1417,"anchor":"Ajustes","linkAnchor":"Ajustes"},{"toclevel":1,"level":"2","line":"Correções","number":"3","index":"3","fromtitle":"1.0.2/pt-br","byteoffset":1574,"anchor":"Correções","linkAnchor":"Correções"},{"toclevel":1,"level":"2","line":"Referências","number":"4","index":"4","fromtitle":"1.0.2/pt-br","byteoffset":1702,"anchor":"Referências","linkAnchor":"Referências"}],"revid":376596,"sourceUrl":"https://wiki.vintagestory.